WEBVTT

00:00:10.611 --> 00:00:16.884
Holding you and kissing you enough to bask in

00:00:16.884 --> 00:00:23.090
Fighting and loving each other enough to bask in

00:00:23.090 --> 00:00:29.296
I want to know you, just as you are

00:00:29.296 --> 00:00:35.035
But I'm the one who can't just be myself

00:00:35.168 --> 00:00:38.171
I don't understand

00:00:38.171 --> 00:00:40.908
Your heart

00:00:41.508 --> 00:00:42.910
Why is it?

00:00:42.910 --> 00:00:47.548
Are you really a sorceress then?

00:00:48.782 --> 00:00:51.718
I want to hold you

00:00:51.718 --> 00:00:55.322
Alone, I cry

00:00:55.322 --> 00:00:59.993
I don't ever want to be alone again

00:01:01.328 --> 00:01:04.331
I want to hold you

00:01:04.331 --> 00:01:07.634
With you, I fly

00:01:08.035 --> 00:01:15.409
I melt into the emotional voice
that almost seems to be crying

00:01:15.909 --> 00:01:21.915
Serenade

00:01:36.196 --> 00:01:38.031
Leki, wait!

00:01:51.311 --> 00:01:52.746
Thinking about something?

00:01:58.552 --> 00:02:00.220
About Miss Azalie?

00:02:02.522 --> 00:02:04.891
Try throwing that.

00:02:24.044 --> 00:02:25.245
How pretty...

00:02:28.415 --> 00:02:30.183
The clam is shining!

00:02:30.183 --> 00:02:31.818
It's a Laimu clam.

00:02:32.686 --> 00:02:33.820
A Laimu clam?

00:02:33.820 --> 00:02:39.326
A red Laimu clam will grant the wish of
the one who holds it, or so the story goes.

00:02:40.027 --> 00:02:41.695
Isn't that romantic?

00:02:41.695 --> 00:02:44.498
But there aren't any red ones, are there?

00:02:44.498 --> 00:02:49.202
Yeah, the red ones are rare,
and even I haven't seen one yet.

00:02:52.039 --> 00:02:55.275
What an idiot to be looking
when it's just a superstition, right?

00:02:59.946 --> 00:03:01.748
Master,

00:03:01.748 --> 00:03:04.451
we've finished deciphering the sorcerous runes!

00:03:07.888 --> 00:03:13.927
Shadowed 1llusion
of the sacred past

00:03:17.364 --> 00:03:19.366
I'll warn you in advance.

00:03:19.366 --> 00:03:22.269
It's a shame, but a part of
the sorcerous runes are missing,

00:03:22.269 --> 00:03:23.970
probably from when we took them out.

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:26.773
So, I'll tell you only what we
were able to decipher.

00:03:27.708 --> 00:03:29.976
It'll probably be all right. Right?

00:03:31.812 --> 00:03:32.813
I'm counting on you.

00:03:33.714 --> 00:03:38.719
These three goddess statues are revealing
the three truths of the Heavenly Beings.

00:03:38.719 --> 00:03:40.220
The three truths?

00:03:40.921 --> 00:03:42.656
The Sword of Baltanders,

00:03:43.056 --> 00:03:45.092
"always something else."

00:03:46.126 --> 00:03:48.295
The Bracelet of Nomafrozis,

00:03:48.829 --> 00:03:50.564
"that brings forth from within."

00:03:51.231 --> 00:03:53.834
And then the third artifact
from the Heavenly Beings

00:03:53.834 --> 00:03:57.537
that the third goddess statue held
was, "as pure as water."

00:03:57.938 --> 00:03:59.806
As pure as water?

00:03:59.806 --> 00:04:01.942
That's the first I've heard those words, isn't it?

00:04:02.242 --> 00:04:06.446
But these three originally
weren't to be used separately,

00:04:06.446 --> 00:04:08.882
but are only complete
when all three are together.

00:04:08.882 --> 00:04:10.417
When all three are together?

00:04:10.417 --> 00:04:14.154
Yes, only when you put
their three strengths together

00:04:14.154 --> 00:04:17.924
can the power of the artifacts of
the Heavenly Beings be exhibited.

00:04:19.426 --> 00:04:23.029
Release from the sword's power
will only occur when the sword is whole.

00:04:23.029 --> 00:04:26.032
And only then can its power be controlled.

00:04:26.666 --> 00:04:29.936
So, if we bring the three artifacts of
the Heavenly Beings together,

00:04:29.936 --> 00:04:32.239
then we can return Azalie to her true form?

00:04:32.873 --> 00:04:34.174
That's probably possible.

00:04:34.174 --> 00:04:35.075
Leki!

00:04:38.678 --> 00:04:42.182
You have a really important
thing for your collar.

00:04:42.182 --> 00:04:43.817
Good boy!

00:04:45.051 --> 00:04:49.523
But even so, I've studied the artifacts of
the Heavenly Beings for a long time,

00:04:49.523 --> 00:04:52.225
but this is a first for something so unique.

00:04:52.459 --> 00:04:56.029
The Sword of Baltanders,
the Bracelet of Nomafrozis...

00:04:56.296 --> 00:04:58.832
The remaining one, the third artifact is...

00:04:59.099 --> 00:05:00.133
Steph!

00:05:00.133 --> 00:05:04.604
Orphen, after that,
the sorcerous runes are damaged.

00:05:04.604 --> 00:05:05.605
What?

00:05:06.072 --> 00:05:09.309
I'm sorry. Just because my magic is so raw...

00:05:10.911 --> 00:05:13.346
Something, there has to be something!

00:05:13.346 --> 00:05:15.782
At least a word that would hint...

00:05:17.851 --> 00:05:18.985
I'm sorry, but...

00:05:19.853 --> 00:05:22.823
That's stupid. Coming this far, and...

00:05:22.823 --> 00:05:23.824
Orphen...

00:05:43.410 --> 00:05:45.045
It... it's an arm!

00:05:45.045 --> 00:05:49.015
It's a mystery.
What amazing powers of life!

00:05:58.358 --> 00:06:01.661
We can win if we have
this guy's immortal powers.

00:06:01.661 --> 00:06:03.597
Even against that super evil sorcerer,

00:06:03.597 --> 00:06:06.099
it'd be just like turning away a child's hand.

00:06:06.099 --> 00:06:08.568
But it's Bloody August!

00:06:08.568 --> 00:06:10.871
Do you really think that it will be our ally?

00:06:10.871 --> 00:06:14.541
That's why we have to make him
in debt to us and tame him now!

00:06:14.975 --> 00:06:19.446
Care for him well, Dortin, in preparation
for the day of battle yet to come!

00:06:19.446 --> 00:06:20.313
Big Brother...

00:06:20.647 --> 00:06:23.149
There's no longer a need to fear anything!

00:06:23.149 --> 00:06:26.720
The ruler of the world will be me,
Sir Volcan Polkano!

00:06:33.093 --> 00:06:36.730
We have confirmed the location
given in the witness' information.

00:06:37.063 --> 00:06:40.634
It seems Bloody August is quite weakened.

00:06:41.101 --> 00:06:43.436
Now is the time to end its breath.

00:06:43.436 --> 00:06:48.642
The both of you, as the elite of the
Tower of Fangs, will leave immediately.

00:06:48.642 --> 00:06:50.377
A moment, please.

00:06:50.777 --> 00:06:52.646
There is no need for Childman.

00:06:52.646 --> 00:06:54.681
What say you, so abruptly?

00:06:54.681 --> 00:06:56.216
We shall hear your reasons.

00:06:56.216 --> 00:07:00.420
It is not possible for Childman
to kill Bloody August,

00:07:00.420 --> 00:07:02.656
his former pupil, Azalie.

00:07:02.656 --> 00:07:04.324
In no such-

00:07:04.324 --> 00:07:05.358
Quiet!

00:07:05.358 --> 00:07:08.461
As long as Azalie is in your heart,

00:07:08.461 --> 00:07:11.197
it is only natural for your
final strike to fall short.

00:07:11.698 --> 00:07:13.099
Am I mistaken?

00:07:14.634 --> 00:07:17.003
It seems the sorcerer,
the pride of the Tower of Fangs,

00:07:17.003 --> 00:07:19.773
is too easy on his former students.

00:07:19.773 --> 00:07:22.042
Beware your words, Flameheart!

00:07:22.042 --> 00:07:22.776
Yes...

00:07:22.776 --> 00:07:27.447
Aside from truth or error,
Childman's power is essential.

00:07:27.814 --> 00:07:29.082
I am in agreement.

00:07:29.082 --> 00:07:32.218
To defeat Bloody August
is of utmost importance now.

00:07:32.218 --> 00:07:33.219
But...

00:07:33.219 --> 00:07:34.754
Do the both of you understand?

00:07:34.754 --> 00:07:36.156
| object.

00:07:36.923 --> 00:07:39.559
As I am sure my innocence
will soon become apparent,

00:07:39.559 --> 00:07:42.595
| would like to watch his example this time.

00:07:43.930 --> 00:07:47.033
And so, I would like to return to my room.

00:07:48.335 --> 00:07:50.036
Hold on, Childman!

00:07:56.142 --> 00:07:58.244
It seems Master has refused to attack.

00:07:59.079 --> 00:08:02.282
As of late, I do not understand Master's thinking.

00:08:02.515 --> 00:08:05.552
He seems a totally different person
than he was before.

00:08:12.025 --> 00:08:14.694
Bring a swift end to Bloody August,

00:08:14.694 --> 00:08:18.131
and with your hands clutch the glory
of the Tower of Fangs.

00:08:20.800 --> 00:08:22.669
My son...

00:08:27.707 --> 00:08:30.076
She's late. That Cleao!

00:08:30.543 --> 00:08:33.380
You did tell her we were
leaving the island, right?

00:08:33.380 --> 00:08:38.151
Yes, she said she might be
a little late, but not to worry.

00:08:38.151 --> 00:08:39.753
I'll go find her!

00:08:40.787 --> 00:08:42.789
| guess it's not feasible to sail tonight.

00:08:43.757 --> 00:08:48.862
Look. It's too dangerous to navigate
the reef around this island in that.

00:08:48.862 --> 00:08:50.330
That's so...

00:08:50.330 --> 00:08:52.065
Don't be impatient, Orphen.

00:08:52.065 --> 00:08:53.800
Let's wait patiently for a bit.

00:08:56.269 --> 00:08:57.570
Maybe...

00:09:02.809 --> 00:09:03.910
Bingo!

00:09:04.711 --> 00:09:06.713
This was a transport after all!

00:09:07.047 --> 00:09:09.082
So, how is it?
Does it look like we can use it?

00:09:09.082 --> 00:09:11.885
| don't know. It's pretty battered.

00:09:11.885 --> 00:09:15.221
I'm begging you, as long as we
don't know when the fog will clear,

00:09:15.221 --> 00:09:17.223
this is the only thing I'm relying on!

00:09:17.223 --> 00:09:18.691
Give me a little time.

00:09:32.338 --> 00:09:34.808
Cleao, where were you?

00:09:35.075 --> 00:09:37.010
You're sopping wet!

00:09:38.011 --> 00:09:39.579
| was out for a bit.

00:09:40.046 --> 00:09:42.449
Besides that, what about sailing?

00:09:42.449 --> 00:09:44.317
The fog is too thick, so it's no good.

00:09:44.317 --> 00:09:45.752
Is that so?

00:09:45.752 --> 00:09:48.588
Say, Orphen, could you
close your eyes for a bit?

00:09:48.588 --> 00:09:49.923
Now, hurry!

00:09:49.923 --> 00:09:51.825
What do you mean?

00:09:51.825 --> 00:09:54.494
We were too late to sail because of you.

00:09:54.794 --> 00:09:56.930
Well, I'm sorry about that,

00:09:56.930 --> 00:09:59.032
but here.

00:09:59.032 --> 00:10:00.266
This isn't a game.

00:10:02.569 --> 00:10:05.338
Right now, it means everything
to me to save Azalie!

00:10:05.572 --> 00:10:09.542
| want to return her to her real form,
even if it's just one second faster!

00:10:09.542 --> 00:10:12.245
| don't have time to play with you!

00:10:18.184 --> 00:10:19.018
What?

00:10:19.185 --> 00:10:20.019
What?!

00:10:20.420 --> 00:10:22.522
What about Azalie, Azalie?

00:10:22.889 --> 00:10:27.727
| understand your feelings, Orphen,
but don't take it out on us!

00:10:27.994 --> 00:10:31.331
After all, wasn't it her magic
that wasn't up to par?

00:10:31.564 --> 00:10:34.033
To top it off, she became a monster
because of her selfish experiment!

00:10:34.033 --> 00:10:35.735
It's not anyone's fault!

00:10:35.735 --> 00:10:37.704
It's all her own fault, right?!

00:10:38.505 --> 00:10:39.506
Master!

00:10:43.376 --> 00:10:44.677
Are you going to hit me?

00:10:55.355 --> 00:10:56.990
You idiot, Orphen!

00:11:03.096 --> 00:11:04.464
No, Cleao!

00:11:10.336 --> 00:11:11.504
Orphen!

00:11:21.648 --> 00:11:23.316
Where did those two...

00:11:26.052 --> 00:11:27.487
| don't know.

00:11:32.225 --> 00:11:33.927
Cleao! Cleao!

00:11:34.294 --> 00:11:36.196
Cleao!

00:12:10.830 --> 00:12:15.935
But I didn't realize that there was
anyone here besides us at all.

00:12:17.604 --> 00:12:19.072
When did you come to the island?

00:12:20.473 --> 00:12:22.742
How about your address, name, and age?

00:12:24.577 --> 00:12:29.716
Geez! Hey, why are all sorcerers so unfriendly?

00:12:30.617 --> 00:12:32.919
How did you know I was a sorcerer?

00:12:33.453 --> 00:12:37.123
Well because that pendant's
the same as Orphen's.

00:12:37.690 --> 00:12:38.658
Orphen?

00:12:38.658 --> 00:12:41.394
Yeah, I had a fight with him,
and then didn't think,

00:12:41.394 --> 00:12:43.363
and ran onto the transport pad.

00:12:43.363 --> 00:12:44.530
Transport pad?

00:12:44.530 --> 00:12:46.332
Because he's horrible!

00:12:46.332 --> 00:12:49.902
He didn't even ask for a reason,
and all of a sudden tries to hit a girl!

00:12:50.169 --> 00:12:52.605
Just thinking about it makes me mad!

00:12:52.605 --> 00:12:54.040
Are you listening?

00:12:54.040 --> 00:12:56.109
| don't have an interest in foolish spats.

00:12:56.109 --> 00:12:57.577
Foolish spats?

00:12:59.545 --> 00:13:02.582
You have made the child of
Deep Dragon your pet.

00:13:02.582 --> 00:13:05.451
| would not be surprised if
a sorcerer was your lover.

00:13:06.753 --> 00:13:08.388
You're wrong! Wrong!

00:13:08.388 --> 00:13:11.324
Why would you think that guy
and me were lovers?

00:13:11.324 --> 00:13:13.459
There's no way, is there?

00:13:15.628 --> 00:13:20.667
At times people express their love
in a paradoxical fashion.

00:13:20.667 --> 00:13:21.934
What's that?

00:13:23.503 --> 00:13:25.071
| don't understand.

00:13:25.071 --> 00:13:28.374
Orphen and I fought,
so what's with this "lovers" talk?

00:13:29.475 --> 00:13:31.544
Lovers?

00:13:32.745 --> 00:13:34.280
What a strange girl.

00:13:35.648 --> 00:13:36.883
Cleao!

00:13:42.322 --> 00:13:44.891
Is it you? The one called, Orphen?

00:13:45.158 --> 00:13:46.225
And you are?

00:13:46.993 --> 00:13:51.097
There's no such sorcerer with
that name at the Tower of Fangs.

00:13:53.833 --> 00:13:54.901
You?

00:13:58.304 --> 00:13:59.472
You couldn't be...

00:14:17.390 --> 00:14:18.825
Burn!

00:14:18.825 --> 00:14:20.360
Burn more!

00:14:20.360 --> 00:14:23.396
Now hurry on out, you monster!

00:14:32.805 --> 00:14:33.706
It's her!

00:14:48.287 --> 00:14:49.455
What?

00:14:58.164 --> 00:14:59.966
Did you see that, Big Brother?

00:14:59.966 --> 00:15:01.134
No, I didn't see.

00:15:01.134 --> 00:15:02.635
| found you!

00:15:02.635 --> 00:15:04.370
Become a rock, monster!

00:15:27.260 --> 00:15:31.264
Although you were weakened,
it was an awfully quick end.

00:15:43.209 --> 00:15:45.445
Are you invincible?!

00:15:45.445 --> 00:15:46.646
It came back to life!

00:15:55.521 --> 00:15:57.757
This storm is unusual, isn't it?

00:15:57.757 --> 00:16:01.327
| wonder if Majic and Steph
are staying out of the rain?

00:16:01.327 --> 00:16:04.363
They probably aren't on this island.

00:16:04.363 --> 00:16:05.798
Why do you say that?

00:16:05.798 --> 00:16:07.433
That man just now...

00:16:07.433 --> 00:16:09.302
The unfriendly sorcerer?

00:16:09.535 --> 00:16:12.405
It's someone you and I both know well.

00:16:12.405 --> 00:16:14.941
He might be a little too young though.

00:16:14.941 --> 00:16:17.076
| don't know that guy.

00:16:17.944 --> 00:16:22.582
It seems we were flown to an unthinkable place.

00:16:24.217 --> 00:16:25.384
What strong rain.

00:16:34.727 --> 00:16:35.761
Cleao...
Orphen!

00:16:36.395 --> 00:16:39.932
Sorry about earlier.
| just got mad all of a sudden.

00:16:40.099 --> 00:16:43.836
Really! It's horrible that you would
raise your hand to a girl!

00:16:45.505 --> 00:16:46.606
Here!

00:16:50.576 --> 00:16:51.844
This is...

00:16:52.345 --> 00:16:55.381
There really aren't many red ones, are there?

00:16:55.381 --> 00:16:57.416
It took a little time.

00:16:57.416 --> 00:16:59.252
You were looking for this?

00:16:59.652 --> 00:17:03.723
It would be nice if your wish came true, Orphen.

00:17:08.160 --> 00:17:09.428
Cleao...

00:17:12.999 --> 00:17:14.066
Run!

00:17:20.940 --> 00:17:22.208
Sword of Light-

00:17:29.148 --> 00:17:30.249
What?

00:17:30.249 --> 00:17:33.085
| stopped time on the island for a moment.

00:17:33.486 --> 00:17:34.520
You are...

00:17:34.520 --> 00:17:36.322
Orphen, isn't he...

00:17:37.123 --> 00:17:38.558
Rocks Row!

00:17:47.934 --> 00:17:49.335
Th-this is...

00:17:49.769 --> 00:17:51.804
The Jewel of Gigabrious,

00:17:52.371 --> 00:17:54.740
"as pure as water."

00:17:54.941 --> 00:17:58.611
Hey, why is the broken statue whole again?

00:17:58.611 --> 00:18:00.947
The sword's here, and even the bracelet.

00:18:00.947 --> 00:18:03.950
And on top of that,
a dead person's come back to life!

00:18:03.950 --> 00:18:05.284
Hey, Orphen!

00:18:05.451 --> 00:18:07.520
The Jewel of Gigabrious...

00:18:07.520 --> 00:18:11.057
The third artifact of the Heavenly Beings
that we were waiting for.

00:18:11.057 --> 00:18:12.358
You mustn't touch it!

00:18:12.525 --> 00:18:15.261
To you, it's an illusion from the past.

00:18:15.261 --> 00:18:16.462
Do you understand?

00:18:16.462 --> 00:18:17.697
What?

00:18:17.930 --> 00:18:19.298
The past?

00:18:19.632 --> 00:18:22.168
| see, so that's what it is.

00:18:23.102 --> 00:18:25.037
What?! Another earthquake?

00:18:25.538 --> 00:18:27.540
Go back to your original time.

00:18:27.540 --> 00:18:32.278
These irregularities are due to
the strain on time you have caused.

00:18:32.278 --> 00:18:33.813
But how?

00:18:34.113 --> 00:18:35.881
I'll lend you strength.

00:18:35.881 --> 00:18:37.817
Hurry, to the transport pad.

00:18:44.757 --> 00:18:46.258
My life?

00:18:48.127 --> 00:18:49.161
That's right.

00:18:49.562 --> 00:18:51.664
The artifacts of the Heavenly Beings,

00:18:51.664 --> 00:18:53.733
the Bracelet of Nomafrozis,

00:18:53.733 --> 00:18:56.235
and the Jewel of Gigabrious,

00:18:56.235 --> 00:18:58.070
if you have the both of these,

00:18:58.070 --> 00:19:02.141
the true power of the
Sword of Baltanders will be released.

00:19:02.141 --> 00:19:07.613
But the immensity of that power
may take your life at the same time.

00:19:11.183 --> 00:19:12.418
Orphen...

00:19:14.020 --> 00:19:15.655
There's no time left!

00:19:17.256 --> 00:19:20.026
Farewell, travelers from the future.

00:19:20.026 --> 00:19:21.761
O flow of time!

00:19:45.584 --> 00:19:48.721
The artifacts of the Heavenly Beings
are too dangerous.

00:19:48.721 --> 00:19:52.091
I think it is best to hide
the knowledge of this island

00:19:52.091 --> 00:19:54.593
from the Tower of Fangs for the time being,

00:19:54.593 --> 00:19:55.961
Childman.

00:19:56.629 --> 00:19:58.531
| am of the same mind.

00:20:00.299 --> 00:20:01.867
The world of the past...

00:20:01.867 --> 00:20:06.672
Because the transport magic failed,
we passed through time.

00:20:06.672 --> 00:20:10.242
Thanks to that, we got to see
the goddess statue from the past.

00:20:11.377 --> 00:20:12.178
Hey...

00:20:12.178 --> 00:20:14.380
| bet it's because of this.

00:20:19.285 --> 00:20:22.822
But Orphen, what Row said at the end...

00:20:23.823 --> 00:20:25.357
I'm prepared.

00:20:26.025 --> 00:20:27.093
But!

00:20:27.093 --> 00:20:28.627
Don't tell anyone.

00:20:28.627 --> 00:20:30.930
It's a secret between you and me.

00:20:30.930 --> 00:20:32.231
Okay?

00:20:33.599 --> 00:20:36.335
Master! Cleao!

00:20:39.205 --> 00:20:41.207
So you two are all right!

00:20:41.207 --> 00:20:44.176
| found out what the third
Heavenly Being artifact is!

00:20:44.176 --> 00:20:45.678
Really?

00:20:45.678 --> 00:20:46.679
Yeah!

00:20:46.679 --> 00:20:48.214
We did it!

00:20:48.214 --> 00:20:50.216
You did it, didn't you, Orphen?

00:21:08.534 --> 00:21:10.636
It was impossible for him, after all.

00:21:10.636 --> 00:21:17.576
But, because of that, those stupid Elders
will trust me this time.

00:21:18.377 --> 00:21:19.545
Master!

00:21:20.546 --> 00:21:21.881
What is it?

00:21:21.881 --> 00:21:26.252
| was divining Bloody August
as per your orders, Master,

00:21:26.252 --> 00:21:27.853
but it's strange.

00:21:27.853 --> 00:21:30.523
No matter how many times
| divine Bloody August,

00:21:30.523 --> 00:21:32.691
| can't sense the presence of Azalie.

00:21:32.691 --> 00:21:33.692
What?!

00:21:33.692 --> 00:21:35.227
It's not Azalie.

00:21:35.227 --> 00:21:36.896
It's a different person.

00:21:36.896 --> 00:21:40.566
Absurd! If it's not Azalie, then who is it?

00:21:40.566 --> 00:21:42.401
| still haven't...

00:21:42.401 --> 00:21:45.371
So, I shall continue the divination.

00:21:47.506 --> 00:21:48.507
Lai!

00:21:48.507 --> 00:21:49.208
Yes?

00:21:49.208 --> 00:21:50.943
O lce of Silence!

00:21:56.882 --> 00:22:00.319
Idiot, it's because you sniffed around
at unnecessary things.

00:22:04.857 --> 00:22:06.425
Childman...

00:22:16.802 --> 00:22:20.472
Orphen will die when he saves Azalie.

00:22:20.472 --> 00:22:23.175
It has nothing to do with me at all.

00:22:23.175 --> 00:22:26.378
But why does my heart hurt so much?

00:22:26.946 --> 00:22:28.614
Th-this jewel is...

00:22:28.614 --> 00:22:31.650
It couldn't be the last artifact
of the Heavenly Beings?!

00:22:31.650 --> 00:22:34.687
And what do you want me to do
with this, Shrimp Man?

00:22:34.854 --> 00:22:36.789
Next time on Sorcerous Stabber Orphen:

00:22:36.789 --> 00:22:38.657
pUZZ1€d BLUE €YES
"Puzzled Blue Eyes."

00:22:38.657 --> 00:22:41.093
PUZZ1€d BLUE €YES
Sword of Light, whom I do release!

00:22:41.093 --> 00:22:41.760
PUZZ1€d BLUE €YES

00:22:43.495 --> 00:22:45.030
What should I do?

00:22:45.030 --> 00:22:47.433
I need you to come after me

00:22:47.433 --> 00:22:51.670
Even if I just kept on walking

00:22:53.239 --> 00:22:54.807
What should I do?

00:22:54.807 --> 00:22:57.243
We wouldn't be able to meet

00:22:57.243 --> 00:23:01.547
Even if we knew each other's cell phone numbers

00:23:02.114 --> 00:23:06.986
Headlights illuminate me

00:23:06.986 --> 00:23:11.290
They're too bright, so I close my eyes

00:23:11.924 --> 00:23:14.326
If I kick my high heels off

00:23:14.326 --> 00:23:16.795
And hold them in both hands

00:23:16.795 --> 00:23:21.867
I could even throw away my pride

00:23:22.034 --> 00:23:30.609
For the first time, I feel like
I might do something really unfair

00:23:31.810 --> 00:23:42.488
I just want to collapse on the street and cry

00:23:43.422 --> 00:23:47.927
Looking for you and fall in love

00:23:48.661 --> 00:23:52.865
Because I'm not really so strong

00:23:53.599 --> 00:23:57.670
If you kissed me right now

00:23:58.470 --> 00:24:03.108
I'd cry, what should I do?

00:24:03.409 --> 00:24:09.114
What should I do with this love?
